  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reef technology in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the demonstration project is to demonstrate the technical, ecological and eco-economic added value of the MOSES reef technology in a real coastal environment in Cambodia.The project aims to demonstrate that MOSES is an effective and scalable nature-based solution for marine ecosystem restoration, that also creates tangible economic opportunities linked to fisheries and mussel production.</narrative>
  </description>
